# 🏥 ICU Control Station - Production Deployment Package

## 📦 Package Contents

This deployment package contains everything needed to install ICU Control Station on your client's server with code encryption and always-running capabilities.

### Files Included

```
deployment-package/
├── DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md          # Complete technical guide (18 KB)
├── QUICK_REFERENCE.md           # Quick reference card (8.6 KB)
├── build-deployment.sh          # Build deployment package (11 KB)
├── install.sh                   # Automated installer (12 KB)
├── ecosystem.config.js          # PM2 configuration (1.9 KB)
└── scripts/
    └── obfuscate.js            # Code obfuscation script (4.1 KB)
```

### Main Documentation

📄 **COMPLETE_DEPLOYMENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md** - Start here! Complete step-by-step guide

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### For You (Building the Package)

1. Place all files from `deployment-package/` into your project root
2. Run: `./build-deployment.sh`
3. Transfer `build/icu-control-station-v1.0.0.tar.gz` to client

### For Client (Installing)

1. Extract package: `tar -xzf icu-control-station-v1.0.0.tar.gz`
2. Run installer: `sudo ./install.sh`
3. Configure: Edit `/opt/icu-control-station/.env`
4. Add SSL certificates to `/opt/icu-control-station/certs/`
5. Start: `icu-start`

