## 🔧 Technical Details

### System Requirements

- **OS**: Ubuntu 20.04+ or similar Linux
- **CPU**: 2+ cores
- **RAM**: 4GB minimum
- **Node.js**: 16+ (auto-installed)
- **Network**: Access to Kafka broker

### Ports Used

- `8081` - WebSocket Bridge
- `3001` - Backend API
- `80/443` - Frontend (if Nginx installed)

### Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│   Frontend (Browser)                │
│   http://server-ip                  │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────┘
               │
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│   WebSocket Bridge (Port 8081)      │
│   - Real-time communication         │
│   - Patient state management        │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────┘
               │
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│   Kafka Consumer                    │
│   - Connects to Kafka cluster       │
│   - SSL/TLS encryption              │
│   - Processes medical data          │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

